    "detailed_description": "In a dark and disturbed universe, there are a few moments of light for us to go on and sometimes it is necessary to move in the darkness, in the hope that we are going in the right path. Light: A Maze Game is, overall, a game about this universe, it is a simple game with a fun, challenging and, as it must be, profound mechanic.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 126 levels, in each one you start somewhere in a maze. To get out you have to be carreful not to touch anything, walls or enemies, in addition you have a time limit to finish the level. You need to pass every level to play the next one, but you can re-play it anytime, beating your own, or your friends, records.",
    "about_the_game": "In a dark and disturbed universe, there are a few moments of light for us to go on and sometimes it is necessary to move in the darkness, in the hope that we are going in the right path. Light: A Maze Game is, overall, a game about this universe, it is a simple game with a fun, challenging and, as it must be, profound mechanic.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 126 levels, in each one you start somewhere in a maze. To get out you have to be carreful not to touch anything, walls or enemies, in addition you have a time limit to finish the level. You need to pass every level to play the next one, but you can re-play it anytime, beating your own, or your friends, records.",
    "short_description": "In this frenetic adventure you will have to run against time and enemies with or without ligths. Go faster each time and break yours and your friends' records by a matter of milliseconds.",
